{
  "about": "Tambour's design tokens: the one source of the shell's spacing, type, sizes, radii and colours. design/tokens.fsx writes design/project/tokens.css (the mock-up) and src/Tambour/Tokens.fs (the app) from it. Colours are #RRGGBB or #RRGGBBAA.",
